OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer reflects on Army
OL,4,Aservice in Afghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the two-minute silence to mark
OL,7,FArmistice Day, British Army veteran Lee
OL,8,FHolmes will be thinking about his
OL,9,Ffellow soldiers who lost their lives in
OL,10,FAfghanistan.
OL,12,FNow a North Yorkshire Police officer,
OL,13,FHolmes has been reflecting on his
OL,14,Finvolvement in the conflict and
OL,15,Fbelieves it should not be viewed
OL,16,Fentirely in a "negative light".
OL,18,FHe was deployed to Afghanistan with the
OL,19,FYorkshire Regiment between 2009 and
OL,20,F2010, and suffered a combat injury.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
