OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer reflects on Army
OL,4,Aservice in Afghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 450 British service personnel
OL,7,Fwere killed in the war - but Holmes
OL,8,Fsays he does not see their deaths as a
OL,9,F"waste" and that military objectives
OL,10,Fwere achieved.
